; ==== the bit that fell off the FIRST byte is the reduction ====
; it is not tested; 0x87 is multiplied by it  so the exclusive or below
; runs against 0x87 or against nought and costs the same either way
L15
  [-R21
    +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
    +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
    +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
  L21]

